Hello!<br>
I was wondering what is the way of using an auto-incrementing counter as a variable name. Consider you are reading a file:<br>
<code>
$counter=0;
while(<>)
{
  $counter++;
  $variable_name = "bin_".$counter;
}
</code>
<br>
How can I then access this name? So like that I will get to know that I have the values "bin_1", "bin_2" etc
